# L §5.14 A hole in a term: "(an attribute that is a hole ...) makes the arcs it ranks undecided. Only the parts the
# take could reach under some reading of the holes merge, into one hole part with the total known"; "A hole in such a
# field is an undecided take".  The withdrawal's `paid_from: key persons` is a hole, so a reading of it is a person.
# sav's order is (if w in withdrawals and k.owner == w.paid_from then 0 else 1), (if k.owner == ania_tomek then 0 else
# 1).  Parts: Ania's 300.00, the couple's 700.00, Tomek's 200.00, Kuba's 400.00 (Kuba a child).  The withdrawal of
# 600.00: paid by Ania it takes her 300.00 and 300.00 of the couple's; by Tomek, his 200.00 and 400.00 of the couple's;
# Kuba's part ranks last under both readings and is never reached.  So Ania's, the couple's and Tomek's parts merge
# into one hole part of 600.00, Kuba's 400.00 stays known, the total 1 000.00 known (scratch/exp_hattr.py).  q2: the
# leg read: the withdrawal took nothing of Kuba's.  (Was LOAD-UNIT "ania and ('hole', ...) compared", the probe
# writer's p20; then, with the row's hole read as a hole, one hole part of the whole balance.)
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-02-10
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-01-31

source src "test"
unit DUK: currency minor 0.01
kind children: parties
kind couples: parties
kind persons: parties
kind inheritances: transfers
  attr heir: key parties
kind withdrawals: transfers
  attr paid_from: key persons
kind savings: place DUK min 0
  owned by arrive
  step minor(DUK)
  takes k for w order (if w in withdrawals and k.owner == w.paid_from then 0 else 1), (if k.owner == ania_tomek then 0 else 1)
place sav: savings lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input bank_rows: observed
def arrive[m in events, p in parties]: num at m.day
  rule community = (if p == ania_tomek then 1 else 0)
  rule inherited beats community = (if p == m.heir then 1 else 0) when m in inheritances

ask q1: bal(sav, 2026-01-31), bal(sav, 2026-01-31) of kuba, bal(sav, 2026-01-31) of ania
ask q2: o.cash.amount of kuba for o in withdrawals over 2026-01-25..2026-01-25

version cast
  cite src
  known 2026-01-01
  children + [kuba] lives 2010-02-14..
  couples + [ania_tomek] lives 2015-06-20..
  persons + [ania] lives 1988-04-12..
  persons + [tomek] lives 1986-09-03..

version rows
  cite src
  governs 2026-01
  known 2026-02-03
  opening[sav] = 0 at 2026-01-01 start
  bank_rows[r1] = (on: 2026-01-05, kind: inheritances, leg cash from world to sav amount 300.00 DUK, heir: ania) "line 1"
  bank_rows[r2] = (on: 2026-01-06, kind: transfers, leg cash from world to sav amount 700.00 DUK) "line 2"
  bank_rows[r3] = (on: 2026-01-07, kind: inheritances, leg cash from world to sav amount 200.00 DUK, heir: tomek) "line 3"
  bank_rows[r4] = (on: 2026-01-08, kind: inheritances, leg cash from world to sav amount 400.00 DUK, heir: kuba) "line 4"
  bank_rows[r6] = (on: 2026-01-25, kind: withdrawals, leg cash from sav to world amount 600.00 DUK, paid_from: ?"whose money paid?") "line 6"
=== expect
q1: (1 000.00 DUK, 400.00 DUK, ?"sav: 600.00 DUK may be ania's: whose money paid?" (sav))
...
q2 (o = bank_rows[r6]): 0.00 DUK
...
